---
import '@fontsource/sora/400.css';
import '@fontsource/sora/600.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <title>Social Posts | NC Digital</title>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="/admin/jobs/">NC <span>Digital</span> <small>/ Social Posts</small></a><a href="/admin/links/">Admin tools ↗</a></header>
  <main>
    <div class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">CREATE & SHARE</p><h1>One launch. Every channel.</h1><p>Upload your images, write your post and choose where it goes.</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="https://publish.buffer.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Manage Buffer accounts ↗</a></div>
    <div id="notice" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking your publishing setup…</div>
    <details class="notice"><summary>Connecting all five accounts on the free plan</summary><p>Use Buffer’s three free connections for <strong>X, LinkedIn and Google Business Profile</strong>. Connect your <strong>Facebook Page and its linked professional Instagram account</strong> directly through Meta.</p><p>Facebook and Instagram schedules are managed here. Manage the other three queues in <a href="https://publish.buffer.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buffer</a>, which allows 10 queued posts per channel on its free plan. <a href="https://business.facebook.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Meta Business Suite ↗</a></p><p>Meta publishing requires a one-time developer app and Page token setup. Scheduled Meta posts normally start within a minute of the selected time; Instagram may need a little longer to prepare images.</p></details>
    <div class="workspace">
      <form id="composer" class="panel">
        <div class="section-heading"><h2>Create a post</h2><span id="draft-status" class="muted">Draft saved on this browser</span></div>
        <fieldset id="compose-fields">
          <label class="field">Caption<textarea id="caption" rows="6" maxlength="5000" required placeholder="A new website, ready for business. Here’s our latest launch…"></textarea></label>
          <label class="field">Website link <span class="optional">Optional</span><input id="link" type="url" placeholder="https://your-clients-website.co.uk" maxlength="2048" /></label>
          <div class="field"><span>Images <span class="optional">Up to 4</span></span><label class="upload" for="images"><strong>Choose launch images</strong><span>JPG, PNG or WebP · We fit the full image into a square, without cropping.</span><input id="images" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple /></label><div id="image-list" class="image-list"></div><p class="hint">The first image is used for Google Business Profile. Instagram needs an image.</p></div>
          <fieldset class="accounts"><legend>Publish to</legend><div id="channels">Your accounts will appear here once connected.</div></fieldset>
          <div class="timing"><label><input type="radio" name="timing" value="now" checked /> Publish now</label><label><input type="radio" name="timing" value="schedule" /> Schedule</label></div>
          <label class="field" id="schedule-field" hidden>Publishing date and time<input type="datetime-local" id="due-at" /><span id="timezone" class="hint"></span></label>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="actions"><button class="button primary" id="publish" type="submit" disabled>Publish to selected accounts</button><button class="button secondary" id="new-draft" type="button">New draft</button></div>
        <p class="hint">Review the previews before publishing. You can adjust each platform’s caption.</p>
      </form>
      <aside class="panel previews"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Platform previews</h2><span class="muted">Content preview</span></div><div id="previews"></div></aside>
    </div>
    <section class="panel history"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PUBLISHING HISTORY</p><h2>Your recent posts</h2></div><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="refresh">Refresh history</button></div><div id="history"><p class="muted">Your publishing results will appear here.</p></div></section>
  </main>
  <script>import '../../scripts/social-composer.js';</script>
</body>
</html>
<style is:global>
  :root { color-scheme: dark; font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; color: #ececf5; background: #0c0c13; font-synthesis: none; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; } body { margin: 0; } button, input, textarea, select { font: inherit; } a { color: #c0a5ff; text-decoration: none; } a:hover { text-decoration: underline; } button { cursor: pointer; } button:disabled { cursor: not-allowed; opacity: .45; } [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #ba9cff; outline-offset: 4px; } .topbar { min-height: 76px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 20px 4vw; border-bottom: 1px solid #292735; } .brand { font-size: 20px; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; } .brand span { color: #a984ff; } .brand small { font-size: 13px; color: #aaa5b9; margin-left: 14px; font-weight: 400; } .topbar > a:last-child { font-size: 13px; }
  main { max-width: 1320px; margin: auto; padding: 48px 28px 72px; } h1 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.2vw, 42px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.05em; margin: 10px 0 12px; } h2 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.02em; } p { line-height: 1.7; } .intro { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 26px; } .intro p { margin: 0; color: #aaa5b9; font-size: 14px; } .eyebrow, .intro .eyebrow { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .16em; font-weight: 600; color: #ba99ff; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .notice { padding: 15px 18px; background: #1e1730; border: 1px solid #4b386b; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; } .notice.error { background: #2b191d; border-color: #784148; color: #ffd0d0; } .workspace { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.13fr 1fr; align-items: start; gap: 24px; } .panel { border: 1px solid #2d2a3a; border-radius: 14px; padding: 26px; background: #14131e; min-width: 0; } .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; } .muted, .hint { color: #aba6ba; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.7; } fieldset { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; min-width: 0; } .field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 13px; } .optional { color: #a29aaf; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; } input:not([type=radio]):not([type=checkbox]):not([type=file]), textarea, select { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #3b354c; background: #0e0d17; border-radius: 8px; color: #f4f0ff; padding: 13px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; } textarea { resize: vertical; } textarea::placeholder, input::placeholder { color: #80768f; } .upload { border: 1px dashed #6b548d; background: #1c1828; border-radius: 9px; text-align: center; padding: 22px 14px; cursor: pointer; display: grid; gap: 10px; } .upload strong { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; } .upload span { font-size: 11px; color: #b6adc7; line-height: 1.7; } .upload input { font-size: 11px; width: 100%; } .hint { margin: 0; } .image-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 8px; } .image-item img { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 6px; } .image-item button { background: transparent; border: 0; color: #d3bfff; padding: 8px 0; font-size: 10px; } .accounts { margin-bottom: 24px; } legend { font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 12px; } #channels { display: grid; gap: 10px; color: #aaa3b7; font-size: 12px; } .channel { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; background: #1d192a; border: 1px solid #3c3152; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; } .channel div { flex: 1; min-width: 0; } .channel strong { color: #f0e8ff; font-weight: 400; display: block; } .channel small { display: block; margin-top: 5px; color: #c1b5d0; } .channel select { margin-top: 8px; } input[type=checkbox], input[type=radio] { accent-color: #a678ff; width: 17px; height: 17px; flex-shrink: 0; } .timing { display: flex; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 22px; font-size: 12px; } .timing label { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; } .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; } .button { display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 43px; padding: 11px 16px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; } .primary { background: #9863ed; color: #fff; } .primary:hover { background: #a572f7; } .secondary { background: transparent; color: #c7b7df; border-color: #483954; } .preview { border-top: 1px solid #332b43; padding-top: 20px; margin-top: 20px; } .preview:first-child { margin-top: 0; border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; } .preview-head { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; } .platform-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; background: #322245; width: 33px; height: 33px; border-radius: 8px; color: #d3afff; font-weight: 600; } .preview-head strong { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; } .preview-text { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 14px 0; color: #d2c9df; } .preview-images { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(80px, 1fr)); gap: 6px; } .preview-images img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 6px; background: #fff; } .preview details { margin: 14px 0; } .preview summary { font-size: 11px; color: #cba7ff; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 10px; } .preview .field { margin-bottom: 10px; } .warning { color: #ffc891; } .history { margin-top: 24px; } .history-item { border-top: 1px solid #332b43; padding: 22px 0; } .history-item:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; } .history-item h3 { font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; margin: 8px 0; } .deliveries { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin: 14px 0; } .delivery { font-size: 12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; } .delivery small { flex-basis: 100%; color: #ffd0ba; line-height: 1.6; } .badge { border: 1px solid #514063; border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px 8px; font-size: 10px; color: #d3b6f8; } .badge.sent { color: #acf0ca; border-color: #35684a; } .badge.error, .badge.unknown, .badge.rejected { color: #ffc2bd; border-color: #7c4947; } .history-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  @media(max-width: 850px) { .workspace { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } main { padding: 32px 18px; } .intro { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; } .panel { padding: 20px; } .brand small { display: none; } .section-heading { flex-wrap: wrap; } }
  .history-caption { flex-basis: 100%; min-width: 0; }
  .history-caption summary { color: #cba7ff; cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 0; line-height: 1.6; }
  .history-caption[open] { border-left: 2px solid #514063; padding-left: 14px; }
  .history-caption .preview-text { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; }
  .history-caption-link { display: block; overflow-wrap: anywhere; color: #cba7ff; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
</style>
